	// EventNameLabel: Runs your workflow when a label in your workflow's repository is created or modified.
	EventNameLabel
	EventNameMember
	// EventNameMergeGroup: Runs your workflow when a pull request is added to a merge queue, which adds the pull request to a merge group.
	EventNameMergeGroup
	// EventNameMilestone: Runs your workflow when a milestone in the workflow's repository is created or modified.
	EventNameMilestone
	// EventNameRegistryPackage: Runs your workflow when activity related to GitHub Packages occurs in your repository.
